WEBVTT

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:23.580
Boo.

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:27.820
Kitty?

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.180
(MACHINE WHIRRING)

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:40.140
None of this ever happened,
gentlemen.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:45.140
And I don't want to see
any paperwork on this.

00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:08.660
Take him away.

00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:13.940
I bet we get the rest of the day off.

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:17.020
You idiot.
They're gonna shut down the factory.

00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:18.060
(ALL GASPING)

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:22.740
When that wall went up, you should
have seen Waternoose's face.

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:25.340
Whoo-hoo!
I hope we get a copy of that tape.

00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:26.780
Are you all right?

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:29.020
Come on, pal.
Cheer up. We did it!

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:30.620
We got Boo home.

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:33.340
Sure, we put the factory
in the toilet and

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:35.540
hundreds of people
will be out of work.

00:01:35.620 --> 00:01:38.540
Not to mention the mob that will
come after us when there's no power,

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:41.340
but at least we had some laughs, right?

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:46.540
Laughs.

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:09.700
MIKE: Is this thing on?
Hello? Hello? Testing.

00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:12.500
Good evening. Nice to see you.

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:15.060
It's great to be here in your room.

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:16.140
Where are you from?

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:20.940
You're in kindergarten, right?
I love kindergarten.

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:22.420
Best three years of my life.

00:02:23.860 --> 00:02:26.780
Of my life.
But I love sports.

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:30.260
Dodgeball was the best.
I was the fastest one out there.

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:31.540
Of course, I was the ball.

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:35.020
I was the ball, see...

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:37.100
All right.

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:44.260
(RUMBLING)

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:45.860
(GURGLING)

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:48.620
(HUGE BURP)

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:51.340
(LAUGHING)

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:53.940
Thanks a lot.
I'll be here all week.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:55.460
Remember to tip your waitresses.

00:02:58.940 --> 00:02:59.940
(BELL DINGS)

00:03:00.220 --> 00:03:03.380
Great job, Mikey. You filled your quota
on the first kid of the day.

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:06.540
Not bad. Only somebody
with perfect comedic timing

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.340
could produce this much energy
in one shot.

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:12.340
And the fact that laughter
is ten times more powerful than scream

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:14.020
had nothing to do with it?

00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:17.980
Googly bear, come here, you.

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:20.380
-Schmoopsie-pooh!
-Googly.

00:03:21.820 --> 00:03:22.980
(SNAKES CHITTERING)

00:03:23.060 --> 00:03:26.460
Girls, stop, stop, stop.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:28.820
Michael, you're such a charmer.

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:31.940
-Did you bring the magazine?
-A whole box.

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:33.700
Let me see it!

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:35.860
Sulley and I made the cover, right?

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:39.180
I don't believe it!

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:41.260
Googly bear.

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:44.900
I'm on the cover of a magazine!

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:52.940
This is great.

00:03:53.020 --> 00:03:54.300
(HUMMING)

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:07.620
(DISTANT LAUGHTER)

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:22.580
-MIKE: Hey, Sulley.
-(YELLS) Hey, Mike.

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:25.340
-I was...
-There's something I want to show you.

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:27.380
Close your eyes. Follow me.

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:29.900
Come on. No peeking.

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:33.180
Keep coming, keep coming.

00:04:33.220 --> 00:04:34.260
-Come on.
-Mike!

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:36.940
Follow the sultry sound of my voice.

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:38.180
OK, stop.

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:39.540
Open 'em.

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:41.380
Ta-da!

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:45.740
Mike, is that...

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:47.820
Sorry it took so long, pal.

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:50.500
There was a lot of wood to go through.

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:53.500
It only works if you have every piece.

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:22.580
Boo?

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:24.820
BOO: Kitty!

